# Build outputs of this sketch. Named explicitly rather than by a broad pattern,
# because the sketch's own text artifacts (rust_out.txt, zig_out.txt) ARE the
# evidence and must stay tracked. A `git add -A` swept a nested build directory
# into pushed history once (task #48); an untracked binary sitting next to
# tracked evidence is exactly that hazard.
emit
proj_rs
*.a
*.o
